  "setupNotes": [
    "Connect external electricity to the big electric pole marked P. Medium electric poles distribute it inside the module. Unlock Electric energy distribution 1 before building. Smelting and every intermediate recipe are included.",
    "Production equipment: chemical plants and/or oil refineries, as required by the recipe. Power comes from the external grid.",
    "Feed only Crude oil into the labeled entrances on the left. Solid inputs use separate yellow belts; fluids use the marked pipe entrances.",
    "Each input has an item/fluid display directly above its belt or pipe. Connect from the left; both belt lanes take the shown material. Press Alt to see the labels. Display panels need Circuit network research: leave their ghosts unbuilt until then; production works without the signs.",
    "Collect Petroleum gas from the marked output pipe. Keep the output flowing or connect your own storage.",
    "Place another independent module after its listed research unlock. Keep its raw feeds and power supplied; no plates, circuits, gears, robots, or advanced-quality equipment are external inputs.",
    "Follow the A–G input displays on the left: A iron ore, B copper ore, C coal, D stone, E wood, F water and G crude oil. Only required inputs are present. Port spacing varies to save space; use the labeled preview when connecting each module.",
    "This oil-stage module takes raw crude oil and includes basic refining."
  ],
